  "description": "SESTEK, founded in 2000 with offices in Istanbul (Türkiye), Dubai and Wilmington, Delaware, sells the Knovvu speech recognition and text-to-speech engines alongside AI agent, analytics and voice biometrics products for contact centres. Its SR API serves SESTEK-built end-to-end models (single-language, multilingual and real-time stream models, strongest in Turkish and Arabic) plus hosted Whisper and Dolphin models, from AWS, Huawei Cloud, Oracle and Turkish cloud regions or on-premises; TTS offers Standard, Flash and Premium voice tiers. Access is through SESTEK sales with credit-based licensing.",
